  <div class="content"><input id="text-toggle-simple" type="checkbox">
    <div class="justification-text">Following the review of square box listings on the EML and EMLc, the Expert Committee recommended cyclopentolate and homatropine be specified as therapeutic alternatives under the square box listing for atropine on the EMLc. The square box does not apply to the listing of atropine on the EML.</div>
